msgid "Insert Form Summary HTML"
msgstr "Formularzusammenfassung-HTML einfügen"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:13100
msgid "Include Fields"
msgstr "Einzuschliessende Felder"

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:13102
msgid ""
"Leave blank to include all fields, or specify which fields to include in the "
"summary."
msgstr ""
"Leer lassen, um alle Felder einzuschließen, oder angeben, welche Felder in "
"der Zusammenfassung enthalten sein sollen."

#: includes/class-ws-form-config.php:13115
